verdicts.reason:
Reproduced at 375x553, iPhone 13 emulation, on all four products: thumbnails 451-503, bar shown at 488, so 15 px are under it. The ring and the lower half of '360' are hidden (/tmp/claude-0/-home-user-super-hot/f4a25b5c-7cd5-585d-b4f3-c7ba36b6c676/scratchpad/gate/c6e/skeptic-gallery-and-bar/shots/pa1-pa2-ring-sheet.png).

