- the first thumbnail: wait, still wait 1.5 s later;
- +100 then -100 back to the same spot: wait.
From 0 the bar is shown again in both cases. OLD waits in every case.

The order itself said 'at the top', so this is a narrow implementation of C6e-4 rather than a regression, and NEW is not worse than OLD. Should-fix is consistent with how GB-3 was graded.

